📜 Qanoon Sathi - FrontEnd

Qanoon Sathi is a bilingual legal rights platform developed by Pak-Innovate for the HEC Gen AI Hackathon. 
The platform is designed to bridge the gap between complex legal frameworks and the common citizen in Pakistan
by providing accessible, AI-powered legal information in both English and Urdu.

🚀 Tech Stack

The frontend is built with a modern, high-performance stack to ensure a seamless and responsive user experience:
Framework: React.js
Styling: Tailwind CSS for a refined UI/UX
Animations: Framer Motion for smooth, professional transitions
State Management: React Hooks (useState, useEffect)
Icons & Assets: Custom 3D animations and gradients

📂 Page Structure

The application consists of several specialized pages to provide a comprehensive legal toolkit:
Home Page: An elegant landing page featuring the core mission and a high-end visual design.
Search & AI Portal: An enhanced bilingual search interface where users can ask legal questions and receive AI-generated answers in English or Urdu.
License & Registration: Specialized domain logic for navigating licensing requirements in Pakistan.
Emergency Services: Quick-access legal and emergency resources.

✨ Key Features

Bilingual Intelligence: Real-time language switching between English and Urdu with automatic text alignment and font adjustments (Jameel Noori Nastaliq support).
Smart Search History: A persistent "Recents" section that allows users to revisit their legal queries and answers without refreshing the session.
FAQ Integration: Pre-loaded legal FAQs to guide first-time users on common rights and procedures.
Fully Responsive Sidebar: A custom mobile navigation system designed for accessibility on all devices.

🛠️ Getting Started

To run the frontend locally:
1. Navigate to the directory:
cd FrontEnd
2. Install dependencies:
npm install
3. Launch the development server:
npm start

